COLUMNAL
VERSION 3

UNITS @BEGIN UU
@END UU UNITS

TYPES @BEGIN TT
@END TT TYPES
TRANSFORMATION @BEGIN KVA
KVA COLUMNAL
KVA aggregate
KVA SOURCE an9
KVA @BEGIN
KVA SUMMARY DateTime @EXPRESSION @call count(table\\e09#Text)
KVA SUMMARY DEFAULT @EXPRESSION @call count(table\\FORMAT#r Z09anZ9 0)
KVA SPLIT "ia 90 00"
KVA SPLIT INCOMPLETE
KVA SPLIT Text
KVA @END
KVA DISPLAY @BEGIN
KVA POSITION 1 1
KVA SHOWCOLUMNS ALL
KVA @END DISPLAY
@END KVA TRANSFORMATION

